          "text": "Site-specific radiation dose at tooth #30 (dosimetric dental contouring / DDC) \u2014 NO ESTABLISHED LOINC CODE. This is a named ODE IG test objective/gap: radiation dose data transmitted from a radiation planning system to a dental EHR has no established LOINC code as of this writing."
        },
